# Place HTML snapshots here for selector tests:
#   bezrealitky_listing.html  — saved from the search results page
#   bezrealitky_detail.html   — saved from a single listing detail page
#
# How to capture:
#   1. Open the URL in Chrome / Firefox
#   2. Ctrl+S → Save as "Webpage, Complete" or copy-paste the page source
#   3. Save the .html file in this directory
#
# The snapshot tests in tests/test_bezrealitky_selectors.py will skip
# automatically if these files are not present.
